### Create a new Course
POST http://localhost:3001/api/v1/courses/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": 1,
  "title": "Advanced React Patterns",
  "slug": "advanced-react-patterns",
  "description": "Learn complex UI development.",
  "category": "Engineering",
  "level": "Advanced",
  "price": 2999.00,
  "created_by": 2
}

###

### Update a Course (Add Thumbnail)
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/v1/courses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Advanced React Patterns 2026",
  "thumbnail_url": "https://example.com/course-thumb.png",
  "is_published": true
}

###

### Upload Course Video
POST http://localhost:3001/api/v1/courses/1/videos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": 1,
  "teacher_id": 2,
  "title": "Module 1: Higher Order Components",
  "description": "Introduction to HOCs.",
  "video_url": "https://example.com/video1.mp4",
  "duration_seconds": 1200
}

###

### Create an Assignment
POST http://localhost:3001/api/v1/courses/1/assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": 1,
  "teacher_id": 2,
  "title": "Build a Custom Hook",
  "description": "Create a useWindowSize hook.",
  "max_marks": 100
}
